[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="ManualPage" load_steps=2 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://src/components/manual_page.gd" id="1_page"]

[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_page")
title = "OPERATIONS"
body = "1  MOVE                    W A S D
2  PUSH OFF / JUMP          SPACE
3  CROUCH                  CTRL
4  MAGNETIC BOOTS          Q   (disengage in free fall; re-engage on a surface)
5  INTERACT                E
6  FLASHLIGHT              F
7  RELEASE MOUSE           ESC

MENUS. Panels and lists use the wheel: scroll to move the highlight, press the wheel (middle mouse) to select. Arrow keys and Enter work too.

THE DAY. Sleep in the bunk (E) to end a shift. The ship keeps running while you sleep - and so do its problems.

READINGS. The status panel lists power, atmosphere, thermal and component condition. Check it after every repair. A repair is not finished until the panel agrees."
